  (text "Pin map (IEKF firmware), rev A:\nMotors M1-M4 PA0-PA3 TIM2_CH1-CH4 -> ESC A J2; M5-M7 PA8-PA10 TIM1_CH1-CH3, M8 PA6 TIM16_CH1 -> ESC B J6\n(PWM 32 kHz brushed / DShot, bidirectional DShot: every motor timer has DMA)\nADC: PA4 ESC_CUR (IN9), PA5 VBAT_SNS (IN10, x10/110); ESC A serial telemetry PB0 (optional)\nSPI1 PB3 SCK / PB4 MISO / PB5 MOSI: IMU (CS PC14) + log flash (CS PE4), IMU_INT1 PA15\nUSART1 PB6 TX / PB7 RX -> ELRS (CRSF 420 kbaud), J5\nI2C1 PB8/PB9 -> expansion bus (Qwiic J3 + J4: GPS board, flow board, sensors)\nRGB LEDs PA7 (TIM17_CH1 + DMA, 4 x WS2812B); VBUS_DET PB1; PB2 free\nNo LSE: RF wake-up HSE/1024, RTC HSE/32. USB PA11/PA12 (DFU, CDC)\nSWD PA13/PA14, BOOT0 = PH3 (pull-down 10k)"
    (at 186.69 17.78 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "88a324a0-92b9-59ab-8266-8d3660cea7f5"))
