  (text "Topology = IKS4A1 Mode 3: the IEKF firmware\nreads the IIS2MDC through the LSM6DSV16X\nsensor hub (samples aligned in the FIFO).\nRev E: the IMU host interface is SPI; DRDY/INT2/baro INT not used (FIFO + timestamps)\nAddresses on the hub bus: IIS2MDC 0x1E, LPS22HB 0x5D"
