  (text "ESC link A (rev A):\n- ACwing 1S power board (brushed): CUR = 0.1 V/A.\n- Brushless 4-in-1 ESC, 2S-6S: CUR scale set in firmware\n  (about 12 mV/A); telemetry via bidirectional DShot / EDT.\n- VBAT 1S-6S feeds the FC (buck U12, block A).\n- No charging through the cable (charger on the 1S board)."
    (at 12.7 262.89 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "4bde1588-9d6c-510a-baa8-968e7a724f3f"))
