  (text "ESC link B: second 4-in-1 ESC (motors M5-M8).\nPins 2-4 (VBAT, CUR, TLM) open: two ESC supplies\nare never tied together on the FC.\nBattery pads J7/J8: alternative FC supply input,\nsame VBAT net as J2 pin 2 (one source at a time).\nJ4: second Qwiic port (flow board), parallel to J3."
